The methods `splay` and `insert` are already implemented. Implement:

```cpp
bool search(int val)
```

The search operation in a splay tree does the same thing as BST search. In addition, it splays the node containing the value to the root.

- If the search is successful, the node that is found becomes the new root and the function returns `true`.
- Otherwise, the last accessed node is splayed and becomes the new root, and the function returns `false`.

Constraints of the test cases:

- Number of operations <= $10^4$
- $1$ <= `val` <= $10^5$

For example:

| Test | Input | Result |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `SplayTree tree;`<br>`int query;`<br>`cin >> query;`<br>`for(int i = 0; i < query; i++) {`<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;`string op;`<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;`int val;`<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;`cin >> op >> val;`<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;`if (op == "insert")`<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;`tree.insert(val);`<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;`else if (op == "search")`<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;`cout << (tree.search(val) ? "found" : "not found") << ''\n'';`<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;`else if (op == "print")`<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;`tree.printPreorder();`<br>`}`<br>`tree.printBinaryTree();` | `8`<br>`insert 95`<br>`insert 200`<br>`insert 80`<br>`search 100`<br>`insert 55`<br>`insert 100`<br>`search 95`<br>`print 0` | `not found`<br>`found`<br>`95 55 80 100 200`<br>`└─95`<br>`│`<br>`└─55`<br>`│`<br>`└─80`<br>`│`<br>`└─100`<br>`│`<br>`└─200` |

Đáp án: ```cpp
// Write your helper functions here
int searchHelp(const int &value){
    Node* r = root;
    if (r == NULL) return -1;
    while (r != NULL)
    {
        if (r->val == value) return r->val;
        if (r->val > value) {
            if (r->pLeft == NULL) return r->val;
            r = r->pLeft;
        }
        else {
            if (r->pRight == NULL) return r->val;
            r = r->pRight;
        }
    }
    return -1;
}
Node* BFS(int target)
{
    Node* r = root;
    if (r == NULL) return NULL;
    while (r != NULL && r->val != target )
    {
        if (target < r->val) r = r->pLeft;
        else r = r->pRight;
    }
    if (r->val== target) return r;
    return NULL;
}

bool search(int val){
    if (root == NULL) return false;
    int val2Splay = searchHelp(val);
    Node* toSplay = BFS(val2Splay);
    if (toSplay == NULL) return false;
    if (val2Splay != val)
    {
        splay(toSplay);
        return false;
    }
}
